# n8n workflow exports — never commit. This repo is PUBLIC, and these files
# embed recipients' email addresses, n8n credential IDs and the VPS/server
# names. They're one-time import artifacts: once imported, n8n itself is the
# source of truth, so nothing is lost by keeping them off GitHub.
n8n_*.json
